// --- KONOHAGAKURE STRUCTURES ---
CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaHokageOffice
"Hokage Residence"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaHokageOffice
"Central command post of the Hidden Leaf Village. Trains Builder Shinobi, provides radar, and coordinates General Powers."
End

CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaChakraShrine
"Chakra Shrine"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaChakraShrine
"Generates vital Chakra flow required to sustain base structures, barriers, and summoning pacts."
End

CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaNinjaAcademy
"Shinobi Academy"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaNinjaAcademy
"Trains Genin squads, clan specialists, courier runners, and field medics."
End

CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaSummoningGrounds
"Clan Grounds & Summoning Dojo"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaSummoningGrounds
"Recruits heavy clan bruisers (Akimichi), giant battle toads (Kuchiyose), and aerial ink beast bombers."
End

CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaMissionDepot
"Daimyo Mission Outpost"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaMissionDepot
"Processes mission scrolls brought back by Courier Shinobi, generating Ryo revenue."
End

CONTROLBAR:ConstructKonohaFireWallDefense
"Fire Barrier Watchtower"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipConstructKonohaFireWallDefense
"Defensive watchtower unleashing roaring Fire Style: Great Fireballs against ground and air hostiles."
End

// --- KONOHAGAKURE UNITS ---
CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaGeninBuilder
"Earth Style Builder"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaGeninBuilder
"Expedient worker utilizing Earth Style and wood carpentry to construct and repair village structures."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaCourierNinja
"Courier Shinobi"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaCourierNinja
"Swift runner assigned to collect mission bounty scrolls from neutral outposts and deliver Ryo to the village."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaGeninSquad
"Leaf Genin Squad"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaGeninSquad
"Three-ninja fireteam armed with steel kunai. Can be upgraded with explosive paper bombs and can capture neutral buildings."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaHyugaSpecialist
"Hyuga Gentle Fist Master"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaHyugaSpecialist
"Elite melee taijutsu expert. Strikes tenketsu chakra points to paralyze enemy abilities and disable mechanical constructs."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaInuzukaScout
"Inuzuka Hound Cavalry"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaInuzukaScout
"High-speed cavalry scout paired with a loyal ninja hound. Uses Fang Over Fang (Gatsūga) to harass enemy flanks."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaAkimichiBruiser
"Akimichi Human Bullet Tank"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaAkimichiBruiser
"Heavily armored warrior utilizing the Multi-Size Technique. Rolls with immense kinetic force, crushing regular infantry and ramming structures."
End

CONTROLBAR:SummonGiantBattleToad
"Kuchiyose: Giant Battle Toad"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipSummonGiantBattleToad
"Colossal toad summon clad in iron plating with twin cleaver blades and a high-pressure water bullet cannon. Can leap over obstacles."
End

CONTROLBAR:CreateInkBirdBomber
"Super Beast Scroll: Ink Birds"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipCreateInkBirdBomber
"Living ink raptors painted upon special scrolls. Executes high-speed aerial bombing runs with explosive tags."
End

CONTROLBAR:SummonGamabunta
"Chief Toad Gamabunta"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipSummonGamabunta
"The legendary Toad Boss of Mount Myōboku. Devastating water cannon blast, giant broadsword cleave, and massive shockwave stomp."
End

CONTROLBAR:RecruitKonohaHeroKakashi
"Hatake Kakashi"
End
CONTROLBAR:ToolTipRecruitKonohaHeroKakashi
"The Copy Ninja. Possesses the Sharingan to reveal hidden units, the armor-piercing Raikiri, and the space-time jutsu Kamui."
End

